# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Each coupling and each work of the barostat in a Python simulation
# (D[python-barostat], #275) against `mdir run` of the same control
# on the CPU, in double precision in the deterministic mode:
# 403 rigid waters (PME, SETTLE) in the rhombic dodecahedron, 40 steps with stochastic cell
# rescaling every 10 at 2000 atm. For the isotropic, the semi-isotropic,
# and the anisotropic coupling with the work of Trotter type, its
# first-order form, and the exact work, and for the isotropic coupling with
# the first-order work: the positions, the velocities, the forces, and the
# cell to the bit, the energy file and the DCD trajectory byte for byte,
# in parts, from a checkpoint of `mdir run`, and into `mdir run
# --continue`; the axes move as the coupling says.
# Inputs/python_barostat.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_barostat.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t triclinic | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ISOTROPIC TROTTER: a continuation with another coupling or work is refused by both front ends
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ISOTROPIC FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic SEMI_ISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic SEMI_ISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic SEMI_ISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ANISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ANISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double triclinic ANISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: barostat triclinic CPU Double: 10 cases passed
